mtmE9yUeRIA&oe=6AB27989"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "634577291814563", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982593_634577295147896_4258915715040137912_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O1E-VKuhnh0Q7kNvwHiQhZ-&_nc_oc=AdoqGfqHAiixy3qGqNj8c6uq5b1QvzMqkxRwVh4zE2TmNaoTgLDxzD7T9V9y33qTYLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQItkz_xjBm0YPO5MT-6J7E8AlprhFlxKOS9RszU40bv3g&oe=6AB28203"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bike Attack Race - Bike Racing Game", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Bike Attack Race is an offline stunt bike racing game where you can become the ultimate street bike warrior. Race against rival bikers on dangerous tracks, perform death-defying stunts, and shoot down anyone who gets in your way. Choose from a variety of bikes and tracks to challenge yourself.\n\nIn Bike Attack Race , you will:\n- Shoot your opponents with a variety of weapons, including pistols, shotguns, machine guns, and even rocket launchers, to slow them down or eliminate them from the race.\n- Choose from a variety of bikes, each with its own unique stats and abilities. Some bikes are better for speed, while others are better for handling.\n- Race on different tracks with different challenges, such as narrow paths, obstacles, traps, and even other vehicles.\n- Collect power-ups to help you win the race, such as speed boosts, health boosts, weapon upgrades.\n- Unlock new bikes and tracks as you progress through the game.\nCompete against other AI players from around the world.\n- Bike Attack Race is a fun and challenging game that is sure to appeal to fans of bike attack racing games. The game is free to download and play, but there are in-app purchases available.\n\nHere are some of the features that make Bike Attack Race unique:\n- Stunning graphics\n- Realistic physics\n- Varied gameplay\n- Customization options\n\nIf you are looking for a fun and challenging stunt bike racing game with a lot of features, then Bike Attack Race is the game for you. Download it today and start racing!", "short_description": "Bike Attack Race is an offline stunt bike racing game where you can become the ultimate street bike warrior. Race against rival bikers on dangerous tracks, perform death-defying stunts, and shoot down anyone who gets in your way. Choose from a variety of bikes and tracks to challenge yourself. The game features stunning 3D graphics, realistic physics, and varied gameplay modes. If you are looking for a challenging bike attack racing game, then Bike Attack Race is the game for you."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8073695456029496"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982566_1339436130284405_6768291854328102902_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=snPoFFzVL-4Q7kNvwFJKzHm&_nc_oc=AdoJ-AEjVyiVdqhagawwDQw5xVvR3Tfu9FzPi0IKOlJB40dOykFqoTomzh33zkWglBI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ_yH8xIk1pd7YFsK6krMDj742JiPQiV--iNZ1zDbtipw&oe=6AB273F2"}, "is_concep